    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-sir35">
        <head xml:id="gom-sir35-Hd1e98">Caput 35</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir35-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir35-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir35-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir35-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir35_1@1-2">Qui conservat.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir35-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-sir35-Nd1e110" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir35-Qd1e113"><seg type="qs">Bene orat</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quia bene operando servat justitiam.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir35-Dd1e122">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir35-Hd1e124">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir35-d1e126">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir35-Qd1e128" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir35_3">Propitiationum.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            Inter <quote xml:id="gom-sir35-Qd1e133">litare et sacrificare</quote> hoc distat. Nam sacrificat qui sacrificium facit. Litat qui sacrificium facit, et quod sacrificio petiit, impetrat.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir35-Dd1e137">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir35-Hd1e139">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir35-d1e141">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir35-Qd1e143" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir35_4">Retribuet,</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            etc. Utrumque, scilicet gratum Deo, et quod in altari in commemorationem Jesu Christi offertur, et quod per charitatem proximo tribuitur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir35-Dd1e150">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir35-Hd1e152">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir35-d1e154">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir35-Qd1e156" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir35_10@1-2">Bono animo.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir35-Rd1e159"><name xml:id="gom-sir35-Nd1e160" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir35-Qd1e163">Quidquid bono <pb ed="#P" n="1218C"/> animo non datur, apud Deum gratiam non meretur. Homo enim videt in facie, Deus autem in corde.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir35-d1e169">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir35-Qd1e171" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir35_10@6-8">Et non minuas,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-sir35-Qd1e174"><seg type="qs">Mystice. Primitiae frugum</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">a quo et boni operis initium et perfectio donatur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir35-Dd1e184">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir35-Hd1e186">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir35-d1e188">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir35-Qd1e190" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir35_13@6-7">Septies tantum.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir35-Qd1e193"><seg type="qs">Perfectam, scilicet remunerationem. Septenarius enim</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sed etiam quatuor principalium virtutum operationem praebet.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir35-Dd1e202">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir35-Hd1e204">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir35-d1e206">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir35-Qd1e208" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir35_14@1-3">Noli offerre munera,</quote>
            etc. Apud Deum non est quantitas muneris; nec persona potentis aspicitur: sed dilectio et humilitas cordis. Ideo non debet offerri sacrificium de iniquitate, sed de justo labore.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir35-Dd1e213">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir35-Hd1e215">Versus 21</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir35-d1e217">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir35-Qd1e219" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir35_21@6-8">Et donec propinquet,</quote>
            etc. Ad superiora <pb ed="#P" n="1218D"/> respicit, affirmans, quia Dominus orationem humilium misericorditer exaudit, qui non cessant, donec consolationem accipiant.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
